      "chapter": "River Conservancy and Harbours",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Major Works of the Whangpoo Conservancy Since 1906]",
      "caption_extra": "Whangpoo — Work done: \"Since 1906, the whole river from Woosung to the Arsenal, a length of over 20 miles, has been regulated ... The major works have been :\"",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "Item",
            "Work"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "(a)",
              "Left bank training wall at mouth, 1 mile long, of heavy marine type"
            ],
            [
              "(b)",
              "Closure of “ Old Ship Channel ” behind Gough Island, together with the deepening by training and dredging of the “ Old Junk Channel ” (now called Astræa Channel)"
            ],
            [
              "(c)",
              "Right bank training works at mouth extended in 1934-5-6 to form a smooth trumpet form joined to the shore of the Yangtze"
            ],
            [
              "(d)",
              "Training works and new island below “Point”"
            ],
            [
              "(e)",
              "Training works below Pootung Point"
            ],
            [
              "(f)",
              "Training works opposite Arsenal"
            ],
            [
              "(g)",
              "Numerous reclamations and bundings"
            ],
            [
              "(h)",
              "Special and maintenance dredging, amounting in all to over sixty million cubic yards, practically all of which has been pumped ashore"
            ],
            [
              "(i)",
              "Protective sill work in the deep hole at Pootung Point"
            ],
            [
              "(j)",
              "Dredging of the Soochow creek (the principal tributary) in liaison with the Shanghai City Government"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 10 as printed, lettered (a)-(j).",
        "Line-break hyphens removed (train-ing, Poo-tung).",
        "No figures to total."
      ],
      "id": "p0141_1",
      "scans": [
        {
          "label": "scan leaf 141",
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/chinayearbook1930000hgww/page/n141/mode/1up"
        }
      ]
    }
